# --- Canonical duplicates of j-<name>-twinned skills (E28_S09) ---
# Every skill below has a functional `skills/j-<name>/` twin (E50_S05). Only the
# canonical (non-`j-`) directory is blocklisted here so the public mirror ships
# each skill's content exactly once, under its `j-<name>` twin. The six skills
# above are already fully private and are not duplicated here. `jenga` and
# `jenga-permission-level` are deliberately NOT blocklisted — they stay public
